| `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.submit` | list of strings | `slurm` gets `["srun", "--export=ALL", "--immediate={wait_seconds}", "--cpus-per-task={cpus}", "--mem={mem_gb}G", "--time={minutes}", "--"]` | a non-empty argv list; a word may hold `{cpus}`, `{mem_gb}`, `{minutes}`, `{wait_seconds}`, `{not_allocated_status}` or `{farm_error_status}` and no other brace | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `render` | The command, before the launched command's own argv, that submits it; run as argv with no shell. Any other placeholder or an unmatched brace is refused with exit 2. | the variables the job receives: `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.env` | always |
